+A new method, :meth:`~falcon.App.set_error_reporter`, was added to both WSGI and
+ASGI apps. The registered reporter is called with ``(req, ex, params, handled)``
+for every exception raised while processing a request, including
+:class:`~falcon.HTTPError` and :class:`~falcon.HTTPStatus`, before the matching
+error handler is invoked. This makes it easy to log exceptions or send them to
+an error tracking service.
